      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Endpoints (API setter regler)\nGET /Tasks\nPOST /Tasks\nDELETE /Tasks/{id}\nPATCH  /Tasks/{id}\n\n2. Input (Hva frontend sender):\n\nPOST /Tasks\n    {\n    \"title\": \"Feed a rock\"\n    }\n\n3. Output (Hva backend returnerer):\n{\n    \"id\": 91\n     \"title\": \"Feed a rock\"\n     \"isCompleted\": False\n} (JSON)",
